the-firm-as-one-program-lines-22 : List (List Word)
the-firm-as-one-program-lines-22 = cons (quoted (cons "- **Q1** " (cons "The market" (cons ": which market? There is one market in the universe of information." nil)))) (cons "  Citadel Securities operates across virtually every market; mathematical structure generalizes across venues, and observations in one market inform another. Separation would require proof of independence, and physically there is none short of disjoint physical universes with zero mutual information." (cons "  - **Q1.1** The price of one stock is not a wise place to start. Start from the whole system: every book on every market globally, with all global data (satellite images of parking lots and much more)." (cons (quoted (cons "  - **Q1.2** Begin with a universal space of activity and information; " (cons "the market" (cons " is the space of exchange of assets grounded in this physical universe." nil)))) nil)))
